# Frame overlays

Before changing overlays, read and follow [OVERLAYS.md](../../OVERLAYS.md).

## Quick facts

- Overlays live in `index.html` → `.sequence__overlays` (unique `id` per overlay)
- Timing: `OVERLAY_FRAMES` in `script.js` (`from` / `to`, 1–300 inclusive = `ezgif-frame-NNN.jpg`); `from` is the jump-to-overlay scroll target
- Style: shared under `/* —— Frame overlays —— */`; per-overlay via `#overlay-…`
- Engine sync is in `script.js` — leave alone unless extending the system
- Copy is Hebrew / RTL

## Agent job

Help the user maintain overlay **content**, **timing**, and **style**. Content/look → HTML + CSS; timing → `OVERLAY_FRAMES`. Inventory existing overlays before editing. Scope new CSS to the overlay id. Do not break the canvas sequence or ScrollTrigger setup.
